{
  "name": "Day 81 Solution: Managing Clients with Automation",
  "description": "Real support-triage (Webhook -> OpenAI classify -> Switch -> FAQ auto-reply or Slack escalation) plus a weekly client report pulled from the n8n Executions API.",
  "tags": [
    "course-solution",
    "WEEK_12",
